      "subject": "semmus n yiɛqemen",
      "rationale": "Lɛedda tettwaseglem: taseqqamt talat semmus (50) n yiɛqemen — tiɣzi tanesbegnen."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "taseqqamt",
      "rationale": "עץ s taɛbranit d 'aseklu\/taseqqamt' — maca mačči d 'taggagt' (gallows) i d-yenni uḍris; taqbaylit tcudda ɣer tsirt n usklu."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "⟨kemm⟩",
      "rationale": "Awal 'kemm' yettwarnan i usenẓa n wawal ובא, axaṭer taɛbranit tessaɣ-d kan tafalkayt."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Tenna-yas Zerec tidibelt-is akked akk wid t-iḥemmlen: ad xedmen taseqqamt talat semmus n yiɛqemen, deg tafawt ini i ugellid ad ṭṭlen ⟨את⟩ Mordeḥay fell-as; ⟨kemm⟩ ad tedduḍ akked ugellid ar uceṭṭiḍ di lefraḥ. Yelḥa wawal-agi gar Haman, yexdem taseqqamt.",
